bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28, 0, "Rust seed native-project mangler binds every text x.byte_len() in a closure to a lone free fn byte_len found by global suffix. bf0dc71aaf8 (PR #12182) pulled os/kernel/loader/byte_utils.spl into the bootstrap_main closure; its arm64 byte_len reads 0 for a text, so the aarch64 Stage 2 candidate refused every cold SCV admission with git-event-refresh-failed. Seed fixes landed in 2e7c7e5ba4b (LLVM mangle.rs), 39fb9d1b0b4 (Cranelift closures_structs.rs), and 3df53082c17 (script flattener + imports.rs); lb_byte_len workaround remains until a full Stage 2 bootstrap confirms."

