    seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28, P1, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "Seed: a free fn byte_len in the closure hijacks every text.byte_len(); Stage 2 cold SCV admission refused on aarch64", src/os/kernel/loader/byte_utils.spl, 49, doc/08_tracking/bug/seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28.md, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28: reproduced with the pinned c6e3ee3c112 Stage 2 candidate (0.5 s) and reduced to native probes built by the pinned seed (byte_len=0 pre-fix, 31 post-fix); workaround tagged at src/os/kernel/loader/byte_utils.spl:49; refusal now names branch and row; status=open pending the seed mangler fix and a full Stage 2 bootstrap."
    seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28, 1, "2026-11-28 Lane E audit on origin/release/1.0.0 (4a0811e50b3): confirmed all three Rust seed root-cause fixes are already in-tree (2e7c7e5ba4b mangle.rs is_text_builtin_method_call; 39fb9d1b0b4 closures_structs.rs is_bare_text_only_builtin_method + bare_method_is_in_scope; 3df53082c17 hir/lower/lowerer.rs flatten_free_fn_out_of_scope + imports.rs bare-scan skip + text_byte_len_out_of_scope_free_fn_spec.spl). Status -> fix-implemented-verification-pending until full Stage 2 bootstrap confirms and retires lb_byte_len."
